{"data": [{"author_id": "2114884465671712769", "created_at": "2026-11-02T11:26:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117216897284386833"], "id": "2117216897284386833", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "📌 Welcome to Chan Theory BTC\n\nWhat is Chan Theory (缠论)?\nA structural method for reading price, developed in China by the trader known as 缠中说禅. Instead of guessing, it breaks any chart into objective building blocks: fractals, strokes, segments and pivot zones. A trend is", "url": "https://x.com/Chanlun_G/status/2117216897284386833"}, {"author_id": "1501183366414356484", "created_at": "2026-11-01T04:14:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116745632006430766"], "id": "2116745632006430766", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《五分钟读懂缠论》01｜分型与笔：市场如何告诉你，它可能要转向了？\n\n市场的转折，往往从一个最小的结构开始。\n\n缠论称之为「分型」。\n\n经过K线包含关系处理后，三根相邻K线，如果中间一根的高点和低点都高于两侧，就形成顶分型；反过来，就是底分型。\n\n它意味着什么？", "url": "https://x.com/BobShao8/status/2116745632006430766"}, {"author_id": "2114884465671712769", "created_at": "2026-11-01T12:16:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116867015080046652"], "id": "2116867015080046652", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 280, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "缠论第一课：分型与笔，用本周BTC走势一次讲清楚\nBTC这周从81971一路砸到76325，你在1小时图上能数出几笔？很多人一上来就画中枢、找买卖点，结果连笔都数错，后面全跟着错。\n\n今天是缠论教学第一课：分型与笔。所有定义都按缠论原文来，不加私货。\n\n一、先做包含处理 https://t.co/RbdBaan1uq", "url": "https://x.com/Chanlun_G/status/2116867015080046652"}, {"author_id": "2795277015", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:06:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117241972431712380"], "id": "2117241972431712380", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 261, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "如果你手里有一把带着 100 个开关的密码锁，穷举出正确密码要试多少次？\n\n2 的 100 次方。\n这个数字算出来，比地球上所有沙子加起来还要多。\n在过去 27 年里，计算机科学家一直笃信一件事：\n对于某些最底层的数学难题，人类永远不可能找到捷径，只能老老实实面对这种指数级的绝望。", "url": "https://x.com/jidifeng/status/2117241972431712380"}, {"author_id": "1473747944704667648", "created_at": "2026-11-02T10:19:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117199962895417485"], "id": "2117199962895417485", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 6605, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "从“两脚羊”到“存天理”——宋朝怎样收拾五代留下的烂摊子\n唐末，秦宗权的军队出行，有时不按正常办法转运粮食，车上装着用盐腌过的尸体。《资治通鉴》只留下一句很短的话：“军行未始转粮，车载盐尸以从。”", "url": "https://x.com/mengyinbeiyong/status/2117199962895417485"}, {"article": {"title": "《心经》与物理 The Heart Sutra, Physics, and the Nature of the Universe"}, "author_id": "2115413014899838977", "created_at": "2026-11-01T00:02:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116682319322808380"], "id": "2116682319322808380", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 51, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "禅修中的领悟：《心经》、物理学与宇宙的本质 Insights from Zen Meditation: The Heart Sutra, Physics, and the Nature of the Universe https://t.co/mxcVcwr8A1", "url": "https://x.com/WalkingWithin/status/2116682319322808380"}, {"author_id": "1706245213411557376", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:51:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117147444962374138"], "id": "2117147444962374138", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1655, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "公孙瓒明明知道赵云很能打，为何同意让他去追随刘备？\n\n赵云带着常山乡兵投奔公孙瓒时，年纪不大，也没有什么名气。公孙瓒手下有三千白马义从，自己又以勇猛出名，一个外来的年轻小将，顶多替他带带骑兵、跑跑杂事。", "url": "https://x.com/JDveif/status/2117147444962374138"}, {"author_id": "1906674253489168384", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:56:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117239549277675679", "2117248180886946225"], "id": "2117239549277675679", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 15, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《庄子•人间世》里有一段有关“无用之木”的论述，它是这样的：\n\n“散木也，以为舟则沈，以为棺椁则速腐，以为器则速毁，以为门户则液樠，以为柱则蠹。是不材之木也，无所可用，故能若是之寿。”", "url": "https://x.com/LonelyZiyu/status/2117239549277675679"}, {"author_id": "2116865870702301184", "created_at": "2026-11-02T06:12:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117137724314677378"], "id": "2117137724314677378", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "BTCUSDT 30分钟缠论简析（截至约78,335）  当前价格在78,300附近震荡，前期急跌至约76,500后有所反弹，但整体结构仍偏空。  近期高点逐步降低，未有效突破前高,上方阻力在79–80 暂未见明显底背驰确认 若785–79没有有效突破并站稳，存在下探前低甚至更低的可能  \n\n#BTC #比特币 #缠论 bitcoin:native https://t.co/om2B63HKzS", "url": "https://x.com/tvzhibiao/status/2117137724314677378"}, {"author_id": "1521086568194211842", "created_at": "2026-11-01T23:19:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117033727071273113"], "id": "2117033727071273113", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 86, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "夷陵惨败之后，刘备病逝，刘禅年幼，蜀汉既要防备曹魏，又要面对南中叛乱。这个时候，诸葛亮没有急着把南征当成一次报仇式的军事行动，而是先把问题看成一个更现实的后方工程：如果南中始终不稳，北伐就只是把军队推向前方，再把危险留在身后。 https://t.co/2Wado46gVq", "url": "https://x.com/SonicAIWizard/status/2117033727071273113"}, {"author_id": "1906674253489168384", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:31:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117239549277675679", "2117248180886946225"], "id": "2117248180886946225", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 97, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "《庄子•人间世》里有一段有关“无用之木”的论述，它是这样的：\n\n“散木也，以为舟则沈，以为棺椁则速腐，以为器则速毁，以为门户则液樠，以为柱则蠹。是不材之木也，无所可用，故能若是之寿。”", "url": "https://x.com/LonelyZiyu/status/2117248180886946225"}, {"article": {"title": "自然疗法（非药物性疗法）Natural Healing: Non-Drug Therapies"}, "author_id": "2115413014899838977", "created_at": "2026-11-01T20:30:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116